led. Select a native classifier with /openai-decisions use provider/model to opt in.\u001b[22;39m                                              \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[22;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[49m                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[23;1H\u001b[2K\u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[24;1H\u001b[2K The single \u001b[38;5;5mopenai_decide\u001b[39m call reported that decisions are disabled. No typed answers were returned:                                                  \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[25;1H\u001b[2K                                                                                                                                                      \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[26;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[38;5;5m- \u001b[39m\u001b[1mroute (choice):\u001b[22m unavailable                                                                                                                        \u001b[0m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[27;1H\u001b[2K \u001b[38;5;5m- \u001b[39m\u001b[1mready "]
